speechtext:
The federal hospital construction grant provides assistance as follows:
1.	$1,500 per bed for mental, tuberculosis, chronic and convalescent beds;
2.	$1,000 per bed for active treatment beds;
3.	$500 per bed for nurses' beds;
4.	$1,000 for each 300 square feet of floor space devoted to those services that provide diagnostic and treatment services to outpatients as well as inpatients; and to combined laboratories;
5.	$1,000 for each 300 square feet of acceptable floor area devoted to training facilities for health and hospital personnel.
